 "description": "The entry expired, so on turn 2 (25 minutes later) mask removes 5,940 tokens from message 1, deep in history. Nothing is cached, so no break is possible and the saving is a write, +5,940 x $3.75 = +$0.02228. Turn 3, 60 seconds later, replays the change: the forwarded prefix is the one turn 2 cached, so there is no break, and the same tokens are now a read, +5,940 x $0.30 = +$0.00178. The total is +$0.02406.",
